<h1>Animalica Body Tools</h1>
<p>thumbs were taking too long. i fitted the tools to the paws instead.</p>
<h2>what the fox put together</h2>
<p>wearable claws, fangs and specialized Body Tools, with metal progression and recovered heads. version 1.6.20 includes optional-metal texture and recipe-restriction corrections. quenchable-head integration was adapted from xthatguyx’s addon; their credit stays attached.</p>
<h2>bring these along</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>game</strong>: 1.22.0-pre.1 or later</li>
<li><strong>playermodellib</strong>: 1.20.4 or later</li>
<li><strong>animalicacore</strong>: 1.1.4 or later</li>
<li><strong>traitrestrictions</strong>: 1.0.0 or later</li>
</ul>
<h2>the check sheet</h2>
<p>the release record keeps the exact version, package hash and test limits. source compilation is a separate check; it does not establish new gameplay acceptance.</p>
<p><em>mod was made with AI assistance. Pls no hate.</em></p>
